# SMD Linux - applications.
#
# One browser with working audio/video codecs, and nothing else: the goal is
# browsing, YouTube and Jellyfin on a 2 GB machine.  The second browser (Falkon,
# ~230 MB of Qt WebEngine) and the standalone media, image and archive
# applications (mpv, ristretto, xarchiver) were removed in 1.1 - the browser and
# the file manager already cover their jobs.
firefox-esr
libavcodec-extra
unzip
xz-utils
